<title>USA: Hein-Werner buys distribution rights.</title>
<headline>Hein-Werner buys distribution rights.</headline>
<dateline>WAUKESHA, Wis. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hein-Werner Corp said Monday it agreed to acquire all of Applied Power Inc's distribution and trademark rights to Applied Power's Blackhawk collision repair equipment in certain markets.</p>
<p>The markets include Central and South America and select Asian markets. Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>This agreement completes a process that began in 1987, when Hein-Werner acquired the Blackhawk distribution and trademark rights from Applied Power for the rest of the world.</p>
<p>Hein-Werner manufactures collision repair, engine rebuilding and fluid power equipment.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
